            "detailed_description": "Do you like Platformer Games?<br>Help Job the Leprechaun to rescue his friend Eri on this retro style one.<br>Collect all clovers on stage and find the door to go to the next level.<br>A horde of goblins, zombies, caterpillars and many more monsters will try to stop you, use your<strong> Magic Hat</strong> to kill them all.<br>You are not alone in this adventure, Catalina Cow and and The Elf will help you with their abilities.<br>Will peace and quiet come back to Leprechaun Village?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>38 levels full of monsters and puzzles.<br></li><li>Retro Pixel-Art and Chiptune Sound.<br></li><li>Full Controller Support.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386420/extras/7dbb68b5b937a1e3541e68dd1f672fea.avif?t=1546333420\" width=184 height=69 /></span>",
